  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Can a rookie cop defeat a lurking menace in an eerie town with the help of his next-door neighbor and newfound love?\n\nPolice trainee Mooyoon starts his career in law enforcement in a quiet suburban town only to notice stray cats and dogs disappear mysteriously. A joint rescue operation between the police station and the fire station brings him close to Taeyi, a young firefighter who happens to be his next-door n neighbor. Together, the two begin to track down leads that unravel a much larger menace. As the mystery intensifies, their bond only grows stronger... until an unthinkable tragedy strikes.\n\n(Source: Netcomics)",
